url: "https://github.com/Drgoksugoc/cord-clamping-maternal-outcomes"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Drgoksugoc/cord-clamping-maternal-outcomes"
abstract: >
  Public reproducibility repository for an observational cohort study evaluating
  delayed umbilical cord clamping (≥60 seconds) and early postpartum maternal
  haematological outcomes. The package includes a de-identified analysis dataset
  with calendar time represented at month resolution, the full R statistical
  analysis pipeline, archived analysis outputs, a variable-level data dictionary
  and the STROBE reporting checklist.
keywords:
  - delayed cord clamping
  - postpartum anaemia
  - postpartum haemorrhage
  - propensity score
  - inverse probability weighting
  - observational cohort
  - maternal outcomes
  - causal inference
